.TH WREX-DNS 7 "2026-10-18" "wrex 0.1.0" "wrex Manual"
.SH NAME
wrex-dns \- dns layer for \fBwrex\fR(1)

.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwrex\fR \fIcraft\fR|\fIsend\fR [options] \fB--layer\fR \fIdns\fR \fB--dns\-<field>\fR=\fIVALUE\fR ...
\fBwrex\fR \fIfields\fR \fIdns\fR

.SH DESCRIPTION
DNS (RFC 1035) over UDP/53. Craft carries the 12\-byte header, one question (\-\-dns\-name anchors it), every an/ns/ar record present in the spec (indexed paths an.0.*, …, tranche 20a\-2), and the EDNS0 sugar (\-\-dns\-edns SIZE and friends append one OPT pseudo\-record to ar, tranche 20a\-1). Names encode uncompressed; dissection resolves compression pointers. A rdata dissects typed ipv4, AAAA typed ipv6 (tranche 7b); CNAME/NS/PTR rdata resolve to names; every other rdata stays raw bytes with typed subfields under an|ns|ar.N.<type>.* paths (MX preference, SOA timers, SVCB/HTTPS params, DNSSEC read\-side shapes — tranche 20a\-2). Multi\-question craft and DNSSEC validation stay deferred.
.

.SH ENCAPSULATION
Rank 40; stacks on udp (parents).

.SH "FIELD FLAGS"
Dots in field paths become dashes in flags (ipv4.ttl -> --ipv4-ttl, --dns-id).
Explicit values always win over autofill and are kept
unvalidated; \fB\-\-strict\fR re-validates (violations exit 2).
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-id=\fIINT\fR\fR
message id (craft: seeded by wrex query) Type u16. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-flags\fR
flag aggregate [qr,aa,tc,rd,ra,ad,cd]; subpaths flags.<bit> Type flagset. Default: 0.
Bit names (MSB first): qr, aa, tc, rd, ra, ad, cd. Aggregate \fB\-\-dns\-flags\fR sets the whole unit; per-bit \-\-dns\-flags\-qr sets one bit.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-opcode=\fIINT\fR\fR
operation code (4 bits; 0 = QUERY) Type u8. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-rcode=\fIINT\fR\fR
response code (4 bits; 0 = NOERROR) Type u8. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-qdcount=\fIINT\fR\fR
question count (autofill: derived from the question) Type u16. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-ancount=\fIINT\fR\fR
answer count (autofill: derived from an.N.* records) Type u16. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-nscount=\fIINT\fR\fR
authority count (autofill: derived from ns.N.* records) Type u16. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-arcount=\fIINT\fR\fR
additional count (autofill: derived from ar.N.* records + the EDNS sugar) Type u16. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-edns=\fIINT\fR\fR
EDNS0 udp payload size: > 0 appends one OPT pseudo\-record to ar (tranche 20a\-1) Type u16. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-edns_ext_rcode=\fIINT\fR\fR
EDNS0 extended rcode byte (8 high bits; \-\-dns\-edns implies 0) Type u8. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-edns_version=\fIINT\fR\fR
EDNS0 version byte (0 = EDNS0) Type u8. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-edns_do=\fIINT\fR\fR
EDNS0 DO bit (0/1, DNSSEC OK; RFC 6891 §6.1.2) Type u8. Default: 0.
.TP
\fB\-\-dns\-edns_options=\fIINT\fR\fR
OPT option TLVs, comma\-separated: nsid:HEX, cookie:HEX[:HEX], ecs:IP[/PREFIX[/SCOPE]], raw:CODE:HEX Type str. Default: .

.SH "RECORD SECTIONS"
Repeated record sections; dissected fields carry indexed paths (qd.0.field).

.TP
\fBqd\fR (settable, at most 1)
the question section (one question craftable at tranche 3)
  name (str; default ). question name, dotted presentation form (example.com)
  type (str; default A). question type: A, NS, CNAME, SOA, PTR, MX, TXT, AAAA, SRV, OPT, ANY, TYPE<n> or a number
  class (str; default IN). question class: IN, CH, HS, ANY, CLASS<n> or a number
.TP
\fBan\fR (settable)
answer records (tranche 20a\-2: settable through index paths an.0.*, …)
  name (str; default ). record owner name (compression pointers resolved)
  type (str; default ). record type (A, CNAME, MX, …; TYPE<n> otherwise)
  class (str; default ). record class (IN, …; CLASS<n> otherwise)
  ttl (u32; default 0). record TTL in seconds
  rdata (bytes; default ). record data: A \-> typed ipv4 value, AAAA \-> typed ipv6 value (tranche 7b), CNAME/NS/PTR \-> resolved name string, TXT \-> raw bytes, others \-> raw bytes hex; typed subfields ride an|ns|ar.N.<type>.* paths (tranche 20a\-2)
.TP
\fBns\fR (settable)
authority records (tranche 20a\-2: settable through index paths ns.0.*, …)
  name (str; default ). record owner name (compression pointers resolved)
  type (str; default ). record type (A, CNAME, MX, …; TYPE<n> otherwise)
  class (str; default ). record class (IN, …; CLASS<n> otherwise)
  ttl (u32; default 0). record TTL in seconds
  rdata (bytes; default ). record data: A \-> typed ipv4 value, AAAA \-> typed ipv6 value (tranche 7b), CNAME/NS/PTR \-> resolved name string, TXT \-> raw bytes, others \-> raw bytes hex; typed subfields ride an|ns|ar.N.<type>.* paths (tranche 20a\-2)
.TP
\fBar\fR (settable)
additional records (tranche 20a\-2: settable through index paths ar.0.*, …; the EDNS OPT pseudo\-record lands here)
  name (str; default ). record owner name (compression pointers resolved)
  type (str; default ). record type (A, CNAME, MX, …; TYPE<n> otherwise)
  class (str; default ). record class (IN, …; CLASS<n> otherwise)
  ttl (u32; default 0). record TTL in seconds
  rdata (bytes; default ). record data: A \-> typed ipv4 value, AAAA \-> typed ipv6 value (tranche 7b), CNAME/NS/PTR \-> resolved name string, TXT \-> raw bytes, others \-> raw bytes hex; typed subfields ride an|ns|ar.N.<type>.* paths (tranche 20a\-2)

.SH EXAMPLES
wrex fields dns

